# esbuild/Playwright transform + node compile cache; swept into 3f195e49 by an
# over-broad `git add`. Regenerable, and the cache key embeds the Node version.
frontend/.tmp-esbuild/

# ── Root-level probe files named "-", "%TEMP%", "*.tgz" etc. left by tooling ──
# ("nul" is a Windows device name; tools that redirect to it under git-bash
# create a real file that git cannot index.)
/-
/-*/
nul
# ── Stale desktop/ release output (no first-party source dir under desktop/) ──
desktop/dist/
desktop/dist-*/
desktop/build/
desktop/.cache/
desktop/socrates-desktop-web-*.tar.gz

# ── E2E diagnostic / scratch artifacts ──
# One-off probes that surface during playwright debugging. Note that the
# legitimate shared helpers _lib.mjs and _mock-api.mjs are intentionally
# NOT matched by these patterns (they are imported by other specs).
frontend/e2e/_diag*.mjs
frontend/e2e/_inspect.mjs
frontend/e2e/zz-*.mjs
frontend/e2e/tmp-*.mjs
frontend/e2e/probe-*.mjs
frontend/e2e/__probe*

# ── Agent / IDE tool output committed by mistake (2026-09-25 review) ──
# AGENTS.md already says "do not commit generated dist/, test reports,
# secrets, or deployment state", but commit ca0bbd54 ("build(ui): 完成生产
# 环境构建并生成资源文件", 42 files / +2,914 lines) brought ~440 KB of raw
# build, typecheck, unit-test and Playwright logs into the tree along with a
# scratch probe directory. These are regenerable tool output: ignore the
# patterns so the class cannot come back, not just the instances.
.qoder-*
.vite-dev.log
*.tmp-repro/
frontend/.tmp-repro/

# Stray debug screenshots at the repo root. The documented convention
# (README "Capture convention", audit F-006) is that only
# screenshot_<n>_<view>[_zh].png is referenced from README.md; anything else
# at the root is a one-off capture.
/form-label-issue.png
/debug-*.png
/repro-*.png
frontend/verify-cdn.mjs
frontend/index.html.bak

# ── UI mockup screenshots (not needed in version control) ──
*.png
!/screenshot_*.png
!site/media/*.png
!assets/buildResources/icon_android_1024.png
!assets/buildResources/icon_android_foreground_1024.png
!frontend/src/assets/connector-icons/*.png
!frontend/e2e/composer-tools-visual-baseline.spec.mjs-snapshots/*.png

# ── Local Playwright debug probe scripts/artifacts ──
frontend/debug/

# ── Large planning docs (not needed in version control) ──
UI-UX-UPGRADE-ACTION-PLAN.md

# IDEA 检查报告导出残留。历史上当这两个路径还走 LFS 时，每次导出 HTML
# 再被 add 都会吞成 134 字节指针（累积 size 虚报到几百 MB）；现在仓库
# 已无任何 LFS 规则，导出请只用 XML。注意 debug/ 下的 XML 报告是有意
# 跟踪的（需要留存查看），不要放进这里。
/index.html
/debug/index.html
